      "parameters": {
        "content": "### This n8n workflow showcases a complete database cycle:\n\n    1. Verifies if the 'person' table exists.\n    2. Creates the table dynamically if needed.\n    3. Get person data from API\n    4. Edit person data field to match with 'person' table\n    5. Inserts person information into the database.\n    6. Queries and outputs the stored data as the final result.\"",
        "height": 192,
        "width": 512,
        "color": 6
